% Inform test case NPCGoingTwistily:
%   The Twisty Passage is east of the Twisted Passage. The Twisted Passage is
%   east of the Twisty Passage. The thief is in the Twisty Passage.
%   Every turn: try the thief trying going east.
%   Test me with "wait / g".

the maximum time is 10.

the knowledge base npc going includes these resources: world, turns.

the knowledge base npc going includes:

twisted is a room.
twisty is a room.
east from twisted goes to twisty.
east from twisty goes to twisted.
thief is a person.

initially the turn is 0
    and player is in twisted
    and thief is in twisty.

if the turn ends from a first time to a second time
then thief tries to go east from the second time to a third time.

scenario one is:
    the turn begins from 1 to 2.
    the command is to wait from 1 to 2.
    the turn ends from 3 to 4.
    the turn begins from 5 to 6.
    the command is to wait from 5 to 6.
    the turn ends from 7 to 8.
